@page "/privacy"
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy – MoneyWeb</PageTitle>

<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="text-muted small">Last updated: April 2026</p>

<h2>1. Overview</h2>
<p>
    MoneyWeb ("the Service") is operated by Delfraisse.com. This policy explains what information we
    collect, how we use it, and your rights regarding that information.
</p>

<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>Account information</strong> – Your name and email address, provided through
        Microsoft sign-in (Entra External ID). We do not store your password.
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Financial data you enter</strong> – Debts, bills, loans, bank account names, and
        transactions you create within the Service.
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Usage data</strong> – Basic application logs (errors and startup events) used to
        maintain and improve the Service.
    </li>
</ul>

<h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
<ul>
    <li>To provide and operate the Service.</li>
    <li>To associate your financial data with your account.</li>
    <li>To diagnose errors and maintain service reliability.</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not use your data for advertising, analytics, or any purpose beyond operating the Service.</p>

<h2>4. Data Sharing</h2>
<p>
    We do not sell, rent, or share your personal or financial data with any third parties, except as
    required by law or to operate the Service (e.g., the database hosting provider).
</p>

<h2>5. Data Storage and Security</h2>
<p>
    Your data is stored in a secured database hosted in the United States. We use industry-standard
    practices to protect your data, including encrypted connections and access controls.
</p>

<h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
<p>
    Your data is retained as long as your account is active. You may request deletion of your account
    and all associated data by contacting us at
    <a href="mailto:support@delfraisse.com">support@delfraisse.com</a>.
</p>

<h2>7. Authentication</h2>
<p>
    Sign-in is handled by Microsoft Entra External ID. When you sign in, Microsoft may collect
    information subject to
    <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/en-us/privacystatement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Microsoft's Privacy Statement
    </a>.
</p>

<h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
<p>
    You have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of your personal data at any time.
    Contact us at <a href="mailto:support@delfraisse.com">support@delfraisse.com</a> to exercise
    these rights.
</p>

<h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>
    We may update this policy periodically. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.
    Continued use of the Service constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.
</p>

<h2>10. Contact</h2>
<p>
    Questions or concerns about this policy? Contact us at
    <a href="mailto:support@delfraisse.com">support@delfraisse.com</a>.
</p>
